tepmother. She is calm and natural-looking. Although she has a fortune left by her husband, she does not lead a lavish life, and Ayuri herself works. Since her husband's death, she has been using her body to her advantage."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She looks young for her age and has a buxom body."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is good at housework in general."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c80732"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"義明の義母。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"歳の割に若く見え、豊満な肉体を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりしており、少し天然。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家庭全般は得意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫の残した財産はあるが、派手な生活はせず亜優里自身も働きに出ている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫が無くなってからは、その体をもてあましている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17092","sourceWorkId":"6354","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9f/9f98ca2eca3941d174a66bbb78e25ded8dd9652c752ceb3b1082ecc88191f5c7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e45b7594ba3b581b0918e1dbac39e162672df5f2240bed4c8540eca45ea090d0.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c80734","characterName":"神楽 理彩","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["17090"],"vndbCharacterId":"c80734"},"originalCharacterName":"神楽 理彩","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A sportsman and a slender beauty."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is cheerful, vivacious, and has a positive mindset."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is winsome and cheerful. She may look brusque, but she is pure-hearted. She has a lot of problems and is worried about her unreliability as a pillar of the family."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a good older sister who takes good care of her younger brother and sister and loves them dearly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"On the other hand, her younger brother always solves the problems in the house."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She still loves Yoshiaki, but it is not in the nature of a man-woman relationship."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"(She is convinced of this, but she has a latent longing for him.)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site, archived"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c80734"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"義明の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"健康的な肉体、スポーツマンであり、どちらかと言えば豊満と言うよりスレンダー美女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明朗快活、ポジティブ思考の持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勝ち気で陽気（ただし感情の起伏が激しく、落ち込む時は大きく落ち込む）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"がさつに見えて純情。面倒見が良く、弟と妹を溺愛している良き姉さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その反面、家のゴタゴタは弟が解決してしまう事が多く家庭の支柱になれない、自分の頼りなさを悩んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"義明の事をやはり愛しているが、男女関係と言った性質のものではない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17090","sourceWorkId":"6354","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/78/785271c1bed9fcd85ab677b971b91834a60a32844cfc985d8afcff2468a3109f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4d/4d1dc2f35b3241bf1c6c2b938ab9fb46dde7317b37579b917571e61c6c3f14a7.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c80735","characterName":"神楽 千鶴","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["17091"],"vndbCharacterId":"c80735"},"originalCharacterName":"神楽 千鶴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yoshiaki's younger sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although her face still has a childish appearance, her body is already hardly that of an infant, and her breasts and buttocks are unusually large. She is a pampered child and a shy one. By nature, she is timid, but she has a keen instinct. Accustomed to being pampered, she has become somewhat selfish. She is very attached to Yoshiaki and does not try to hide her feelings for him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She sees Mika being attacked by the protagonist, but is unable to tell anyone about it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site, archived"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c80735"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"義明の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まだ顔に幼さの残るが、細身の体はすでに幼児体型と言い難く、胸と尻が異様に大きい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"甘えん坊、内弁慶。本質的には臆病、カンは鋭い部分あり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"甘やかされるのに慣れて、やや我が儘になっている面がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"義明にベタベタに甘えていて、思慕の念を隠そうともしない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美佳が主人公に襲われる所を見てしまうが、それを誰にも言えず思い悩む。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17091","sourceWorkId":"6354","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/43/43d0a9a62ff57bf9ff25c3d4360b3a86a92b2df8cd8ede37adc4cacad237e737.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/53/5375e3cb44700d02b2746e5e05bfc1b5c5a19458cf466abca65fc407b441a09c.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c80737","characterName":"奏山 美佳","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"146592","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"68255"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17093"],"vndbCharacterId":"c80737"},"originalCharacterName":"奏山 美佳","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl who is a cousin and childhood friend of Yoshiaki. Though she has feelings for Yoshiaki, she can't confess to him. She can't go along with the women of the Kagura family. She becomes the protagonist's first victim but, because he has the same face as Yoshiaki, she mistakes one for another and stays confused for some time."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site, archived"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c80737"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"義明の従兄弟で幼なじみの少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無口で生真面目な性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"義明に好意を寄せているが、今だ告白できずにいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"よって、神楽家の女性とは反りが合わない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公によりの最初の犠牲者となるが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"義明と顔が同じために勘違いし、暫く混乱することになる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17093","sourceWorkId":"6354","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"義明の従兄弟で幼なじみの少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無口で生真面目な性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"義明に好意を寄せているが、今だ告白できずにいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"よって、神楽家の女性とは反りが合わない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公によりの最初の犠牲者となるが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"義明と顔が同じために勘違いし、暫く混乱することになる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"146592"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9b/9b3ce7840fc53ee8cc70d7ed15d0d6d9895f8ed7d72161026a7428302cbe366c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c4/c4f56ca94856ea4c0b848d3e05943c7a40cb882fffada66c2865717700109d16.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"春日 りか","creatorId":"vndb:s1622","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1622","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1622","name":"春日 りか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:32861","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c98547","characterName":"犬","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["17088"],"vndbCharacterId":"c98547"},"originalCharacterName":"犬","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist of this story."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Abandoned as a child by his father, he was given the name “dog” and raised by abusive parents. As a result, his personality is distorted. He was severely traumatised when he was a child, and since then he has been able to read people's emotions when he is sexually aroused. In order to take revenge on his father who abandoned him, he wandered around Japan, committing repeated assaults and crimes. He lives his life as a vagabond and develops bestial strength, vigour, and resilience. He is a cold-blooded nihilist and sadist who feels resentment about peaceful homes and women. He is a beautiful man in his own right."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site, archived"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c98547"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本編の主人公。人でなしの父親に幼少時に捨てられ、犬という名前をつけられ育て親の元で虐待を受け育つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ゆえに人格が歪んでしまっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼少時に大怪我をおい、それ以降性的興奮時に人の感情を読むことが出来るようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分を捨てた父親に復讐するため、暴行と犯罪を繰り返しながら日本中を放浪。浮浪者として生活を送っていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"兄弟の義樹と容姿はそっくり。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17088","sourceWorkId":"6354","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c80739","characterName":"神楽 義樹","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c80739"},"originalCharacterName":"神楽 義樹","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a young man who looks exactly like the main character."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is mild-mannered, intelligent, and has good grades. He seems to be out of the loop, but his instincts are sharp. He always has a smiling expression on his face, but the expression itself does not change much. His father, who was well-liked by everyone in the family and seemingly happy at home, burned himself to death, and he is practically the centre of the family."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His real mother is presumed to have disappeared. After meeting the protagonist again, he takes care of him in any way he can."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site, archived"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c80739"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f2/f2cfd6777e44683c894095d669e8ce21ca5de89194741cc5d81aa4ef7126d2b2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6b/6be9a652e598dbcdd56e2c900b14b89db2fa78f58b3dca8256a6f8deda828fa8.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p166","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:1514","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p166","name":"CARMINE","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:6354:1514","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p166","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p166","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p166","name":"Carmine","roleCodes":["developer"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:12968:v5664","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p774","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p774","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p774","name":"Deeper","roleCodes":["developer"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:12969:v5664","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p1439","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p1439","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1439","name":"アセンブラージュ株式会社","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:12970:v5664","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p16